  <h2 id="client">MdbaseCollectionClient</h2>
  <p>
    Construct with any <code>MdbaseCollectionTransport</code>. It exposes the
    record, query, view, type, validation, and timer methods above without
    registration, authorization, routing, or notification-channel methods.
    Domain packages should prefer this dependency when they do not need OAuth.
  </p>

